<title>UK: DePfa adds 500 mln marks to Jan 2002 bond.</title>
<headline>DePfa adds 500 mln marks to Jan 2002 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 1.5 billion marks from 1.0 billion marks, joint lead managers Bayerische Vereinsbank, Commerzbank and Goldman Sachs said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE PFANDBRIEF- UND HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT  **1.5 BLN DEM   COUPON     4.75	MATURITY    28.JAN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.13    PAY DATE    13.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NOTES    **ORIGINAL 1.0 BLN MARKS BOND LAUNCHED 08.JAN</p>
<p>		PLUS ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/=     DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
